ative of poker hands compared to `Max_Rank_Frequency`, which focuses on rank repetition. Unique_Rank_Count does not differentiate between important repeated rank patterns like pairs or triplets.\n```end\n\n#### Dropping `Is_Straight_Sequence`\n```python\n# Explanation why the column Is_Straight_Sequence is dropped\ndf.drop(columns=['Is_Straight_Sequence'], inplace=True)\n\n# Reason: While Is_Straight_Sequence captures sequence straightness, it is limited in accounting for Flush hands or Royal Flush patterns. The new features (e.g., `Is_Royal_Flush_Pattern`) incorporate sequence checks with suit conditions, rendering Is_Straight_Sequence redundant.\n```end"]
