ns=['Rank_Differences_Mean'], inplace=True)\n# Usefulness: The mean provides only an average measure of sequential tendencies, which is less informative compared to a combination of the newly engineered features Rank_Differences_Std and Unique_Rank_Count. These features provide a better representation of sequential variability and rank diversity in the hand.\nend\n\npython\n# Explanation why the column 'V3' (Suit of card #2) is dropped\ndf.drop(columns=['V3'], inplace=True)\n# Usefulness: Raw suit attributes like V3 are no longer needed after creating Total_Same_Suit_Cards, which comprehensively captures the important aspect of suit overlap. Dropping this column reduces redundancy, improving data efficiency without sacrificing predictive power.\nend"), with improvements -
